"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The US has threatened to isolate countries that continue to do business with Iran, which sells much of its oil to China.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Threatens Countries\",            \"translated_version\": \"Estados Unidos ha amenazado con aislar a los pa\u00edses que sigan haciendo negocios con Ir\u00e1n, que vende mucho de su petr\u00f3leo a China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"EEUU amenaza a pa\u00edses\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The trial of a Libyan man has been delayed for the third time after new evidence in the 37-year-old case was discovered three days ago.\",            \"english_title\": \"Libyan Trial Delayed\",            \"translated_version\": \"El juicio de un hombre libio se ha retrasado por tercera vez despu\u00e9s de que se descubrieron nuevas pruebas en el caso de hace 37 a\u00f1os hace tres d\u00edas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Juicio libio retrasado\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Mark Carney accused Trump of wanting to harm Canada's auto industry and said he would only resume trade talks if the US approaches with the right attitude.\",            \"english_title\": \"Carney Accuses Trump\",            \"translated_version\": \"Mark Carney acus\u00f3 a Trump de querer da\u00f1ar la industria automotriz de Canad\u00e1 y dijo que solo reanudar\u00eda las conversaciones comerciales si Estados Unidos se acerca con la actitud correcta.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Carney acusa a Trump\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The Trump administration has accepted Syria's new president, Ahmed al-Sharaa, who was formerly linked to al-Qaeda.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Accepts Syrian President\",            \"translated_version\": \"La administraci\u00f3n de Trump ha aceptado al nuevo presidente de Siria, Ahmed al-Sharaa, quien antes estaba vinculado a al-Qaeda.\",            \"translated_title\": \"EEUU acepta presidente sirio\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The south-western village of Pomas was severely affected, with hundreds of homes damaged and fifteen people taken to the hospital. Officials are worried that winds could spread the fire for two more days, and many locals are still under evacuation orders.\",            \"english_title\": \"Pomas Village Affected\",            \"translated_version\": \"El pueblo del suroeste de Pomas fue gravemente afectado, con cientos de casas da\u00f1adas y quince personas llevadas al hospital. Los oficiales est\u00e1n preocupados de que los vientos puedan extender el fuego por dos d\u00edas m\u00e1s, y muchos locales todav\u00eda est\u00e1n bajo \u00f3rdenes de evacuaci\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Pueblo de Pomas afectado\"        }    ]}"